flowchart TB
    U[Customer Browser] -->|HTTPS| RP[Reverse Proxy / TLS]
    A[Administrator Browser] -->|HTTPS| RP
    RP --> WEB[Web/API Container\nReact + Express]

    WEB --> AUTH[Native Auth & Authorization\nOpaque Sessions + CSRF + RBAC]
    WEB --> API[Tenant-Scoped REST Services]
    WEB --> BILL[PayPal Billing & Webhook Handler]
    WEB --> MEDIA[Protected Media Controller]

    AUTH --> DB[(MySQL 8\nUsers, Sessions, Roles)]
    API --> DB
    BILL --> DB
    MEDIA --> DB

    API -->|Create draft / enqueue| DB
    WORKER[Worker Container\nDurable Lease + Heartbeat] -->|Claim queued work| DB
    WORKER --> PIPE[Idempotent Film Pipeline]
    PIPE --> LLM[Script / TTS Provider]
    PIPE --> IMG[High-Fidelity Image Edit\nProduct Reference First]
    PIPE --> VIDEO[Video / Lip-Sync Providers]
    PIPE --> FFMPEG[FFmpeg + Python Assembly\n16:9 · 9:16 · 1:1]

    API --> STORE[(Private Tenant Storage\nLocal Adapter / S3-Compatible)]
    MEDIA --> STORE
    PIPE --> STORE
    FFMPEG --> STORE

    ADMIN[Admin Services\nUnlimited Entitlement + Audited Access] --> DB
    API --> ADMIN

    OBS[Structured Logs / Health / Metrics] --- WEB
    OBS --- WORKER

